"Server port is unreachable. Check the address, network, and server service." = "服务器端口不可达，请检查地址、网络和服务器服务。";
"Enable to remember the current network. No automatic mount occurs until you save." = "开启后记住当前网络，保存前不会自动挂载。";
"Automatic mounting uses saved networks or a VPN route. Turning it off keeps your saved networks and stops future attempts; existing mounts stay connected." = "在已保存的网络或 VPN 路由下自动挂载。关闭后保留网络规则并停止后续尝试，已挂载的共享保持连接。";
